        "content": "```python\ndef solution():\n    # Define variables name and value\n    strike_price = 145\n    expiration_price = 140\n    premium_per_share = 3.25\n    contracts = 5\n    shares_per_contract = 100\n\n    # Do math calculation to get the answer\n    intrinsic_value_per_share = max(0, strike_price - expiration_price)\n    profit_per_share = intrinsic_value_per_share - premium_per_share\n    net_profit_or_loss = profit_per_share * contracts * shares_per_contract\n\n    # Return answer\n    return round(net_profit_or_loss)\n```",
